{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dhtthbmgxv1795442844.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國晶片巨頭輝達重新任命黃仁勳為行政總裁。</p><p></p><p>董事會一致通過相關決定，指合乎公司、股東的最佳利益。</p><p></p><p>多次表態支持黃仁勳復職的美國總統特朗普形容，董事會做了正確決定。相信黃仁勳復職不會對國家安全構成威脅。</p><p></p><p>黃仁勳早前承認婚外情並捲入中國間諜風波，宣布辭任輝達行政總裁。</p><p></p><p>中方重申所謂「中國間諜」論，純屬捕風捉影、污衊抹黑。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:56:02.378966+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:26.257651+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:26.257651+00:00","content_hash":"c234ab2758fec73a079a7d783adeb12fc569cc03c112adba5f3d82c2301d24c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}